      "tr": "`HEALTHCHECK --interval=2s --timeout=3s --retries=15 CMD python -c \"...\"`.",
      "en": "`HEALTHCHECK --interval=2s --timeout=3s --retries=15 CMD python -c \"...\"`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**api/Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY server.py .\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=2s --timeout=3s --retries=15 \\\n  CMD python -c \"import urllib.request as u; u.urlopen('http://localhost:8000')\"\nCMD [\"python\", \"server.py\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**api/Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY server.py .\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=2s --timeout=3s --retries=15 \\\n  CMD python -c \"import urllib.request as u; u.urlopen('http://localhost:8000')\"\nCMD [\"python\", \"server.py\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "dockerfile",
      "file": "api/Dockerfile",
      "rule": "has",
